      "title": "H3 prompt | UNIVERSAL IMAGE EDITOR 16",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.45.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageConditioning"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit the provided image_1 by ADDING TYPOGRAPHY ONLY. This is a strict image preservation task.\n\nKeep the original photograph completely unchanged. Preserve the exact same person, facial features, expression, hairstyle, sunglasses, jacket, colors, lighting, geometric background, framing, camera angle, and image proportions. Do not crop, extend, redraw, retouch, enhance, recolor, or regenerate any part of the original image.\n\nCreate an elegant, high-impact YouTube thumbnail text overlay using these EXACT words:\n\nH3-IMAGE\nCOMFYUI\nOPTIMIZED WORKFLOWS\n\nPlace the typography mainly across the lower third of the image, avoiding the woman's eyes, glasses, nose, and mouth.\n\n\"H3-IMAGE\" is the dominant headline: very large, bold, modern white sans-serif typography, with \"H3\" highlighted in bright cyan.\n\n\"COMFYUI\" is a smaller secondary heading in white.\n\n\"OPTIMIZED WORKFLOWS\" is a compact uppercase subtitle in cyan, positioned below the main heading.\n\nUse precise typography, consistent letter spacing, sharp edges, professional graphic design, and excellent readability at small thumbnail size.\n\nAdd only a subtle dark translucent gradient or soft shadow directly behind the text if necessary for contrast. Do not otherwise modify the image.\n\nKeep every letter fully visible inside the image boundaries with safe margins. Avoid overlapping the woman's face. Do not add any logos, icons, symbols, watermarks, extra words, frames, decorative graphics, or AI-themed elements.\n\nThe final image must be the original photograph with only the requested professionally designed text overlay added.",
        4608,
        3456
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "Edit the provided image_1 by ADDING TYPOGRAPHY ONLY. This is a strict image preservation task.\n\nKeep the original photograph completely unchanged. Preserve the exact same person, facial features, expression, hairstyle, sunglasses, jacket, colors, lighting, geometric background, framing, camera angle, and image proportions. Do not crop, extend, redraw, retouch, enhance, recolor, or regenerate any part of the original image.\n\nCreate an elegant, high-impact YouTube thumbnail text overlay using these EXACT words:\n\nH3-IMAGE\nCOMFYUI\nOPTIMIZED WORKFLOWS\n\nPlace the typography mainly across the lower third of the image, avoiding the woman's eyes, glasses, nose, and mouth.\n\n\"H3-IMAGE\" is the dominant headline: very large, bold, modern white sans-serif typography, with \"H3\" highlighted in bright cyan.\n\n\"COMFYUI\" is a smaller secondary heading in white.\n\n\"OPTIMIZED WORKFLOWS\" is a compact uppercase subtitle in cyan, positioned below the main heading.\n\nUse precise typography, consistent letter spacing, sharp edges, professional graphic design, and excellent readability at small thumbnail size.\n\nAdd only a subtle dark translucent gradient or soft shadow directly behind the text if necessary for contrast. Do not otherwise modify the image.\n\nKeep every letter fully visible inside the image boundaries with safe margins. Avoid overlapping the woman's face. Do not add any logos, icons, symbols, watermarks, extra words, frames, decorative graphics, or AI-themed elements.\n\nThe final image must be the original photograph with only the requested professionally designed text overlay added.",
        "width": 4608,
        "height": 3456
      }
