        "1) Connect Picture 1 as the main target image.\n2) Optionally connect Picture 2–16 as extra references.\n3) Write a clear prompt explaining which picture controls what.\n4) Choose aspect ratio and target MP.\n5) Generate.\n\nThis workflow is meant for generic editing, multi-image edits, compositing and reference-guided generation."
