      "title": "QUALITY / RESOLUTION — UNIVERSAL 16",
      "properties": {
        "text": "",
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Use 4 MP for fast tests.\nUse 8 MP for balanced iterations.\nUse 16 MP as the main quality baseline.\nUse 20 MP when you want a higher-detail attempt.\n\nIf source images have very different framing or detail, results can vary more at higher MP because the model has more room to reinterpret the edit."
